1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch17","children":["FOSA丨17丨微服务架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨17丨微服务架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十七章的课后思考题，深入探讨微服务架构中限界上下文的核心作用、服务粒度划分的三大原则、sidecar模式的功能特性，以及编排与编舞的通信机制差异、saga分布式事务模式、微服务的敏捷性优势与性能挑战，帮助理解微服务架构的领域驱动设计理念和分布式系统复杂性，提升架构师在构建现代分布式系统时的微服务拆分能力和架构治理水平。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-23T11:02:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/23"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,815"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十七章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why is the bounded context concept so critical for microservices architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为什么限界上下文的概念对于微服务来说如此重要？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are three ways of determining if you have the right level of granularity in a microservice?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在划分微服务粒度的时候，哪三个方面是你需要重点考虑的？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What functionality might be contained within a sidecar?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"sidecar 有哪些功能？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the difference between orchestration and choreography? Which does microservices support? Is one communication style easier in microservices?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"编舞（orchestration）和编排（choreography）的区别是什么？微服务支持哪种模式？在微服务中，哪种通信方式更简便？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is a saga in microservices?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在微服务中，saga 是什么?"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why are agility, testability, and deployability so well supported in microservices?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为什么敏捷性、可测试性和可部署性在微服务架构中表现良好？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are two reasons performance is usually an issue in microservices?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在微服务中，性能问题的两个核心因素是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-7",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Is microservices a domain-partitioned architecture or a technically partitioned one?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"微服务架构是领域分区还是技术分区？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-8",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Describe a topology where a microservices ecosystem might be only a single quantum."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"描述一种拓扑结构，其中微服务生态系统可能仅有一个架构量子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-9",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"How was domain reuse addressed in microservices? How was operational reuse addressed?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"微服务中是如何解决领域复用问题的？又是如何解决运维复用问题的呢？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f"]}]}],"$L40","$L41","$L42"]}],"$L43"]}]]}]}]
